WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
--------------------
v3.3.0 shipped a license schism: `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` declared MIT
while `lean/LearnedTimeout.lean` carried AGPL/EUPL. The v2 author's review
caught it. One artifact, one license story — and `tests/run_tests.sh`
(`test_license_is_one_story`) now fails the build if any shipped file
disagrees with this one, so the schism cannot silently return.

Every source file carries the SPDX identifier above. The identifier is the
authority; this file is the human-readable copy.
